age a variety of resources, from food to building materials. Keep in mind that resources decay over time, so plan wisely not to waste them!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3674250/extras/resources_final.gif?t=1746665941\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Feed Your Disciples</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Ensure your disciples don\u2019t go hungry! Balanced nutrition is key to maintaining their health and productivity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3674250/extras/recipes_final.gif?t=1746665941\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Random Events</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Face random events that can either challenge or benefit your sect. Adapt your strategies to weather natural disasters or seize unexpected opportunities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3674250/extras/events_resized.gif?t=1746665941\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your journey as a sect leader has just begun. Build a strong, prosperous sect, guide your disciples wisely, and cultivate a legacy that will be remembered for generations.</p>","developers":["Alena Selezneva"],"fullgame":{"appid":"3438530","name":"Sect Leader's Decree"},"genres":[{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3674250/91329f30cb08740377b1416eac66606cf9d8b5eb/header.jpg?t=1746665941","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257133678,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257133678/movie480.mp4?t=1746217560","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.c